{
	"name": "Reflected Power",
	"type": "feature",
	"img": "icons/magic/defensive/shield-barrier-deflect-teal.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>At 13th level, your ability to redirect the magical power of other spellcasters improves dramatically, allowing you to expend 2 exertion as a reaction to attempt to completely alter another spellcaster’s targets. So long as a spell or magical effect enters your threatened area, including line of sight to targets beyond your threatened area, you may attempt to reflect the spell. Roll your arcana check using your spellcasting ability modifier against the same DC as you would for @UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.wQ4Nfo1TleyI7xLC]{Redirected Power}, or against the caster’s spell save DC, whichever is higher. On a success, you may instead choose new targets or a new area for the spell as if you had cast it from your current space.</p>",
